{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The marker fix appears narrower than the ruling: it still interprets a well-formed guest map with a marker’s shape as an internal marker. I’m checking that boundary alongside the mutation tests. The child-budget change was left out; the report explains that it requires threading the budget through several functions, which the ruling allowed the author to defer."}}
